  "instruction": "Use FreeCAD with the Path/CAM modules. Read the initial file(s) from the Desktop path(s): /home/user/Desktop/revision_A.step, /home/user/Desktop/revision_B.step. Compare the pocket-size and hole-position changes between revisions A and B. Generate the final FreeCAD Path/CAM Job and NC only for revision_B. Tool definitions: use the supplied end mill and drill to program revision_B only. Write the required output file(s) to the output folder using exactly these absolute file paths: /home/user/Desktop/task-36_B.nc.",
  "source": "https://wiki.freecad.org/CAM_scripting；https://wiki.freecad.org/CAM_Job https://wiki.freecad.org/CAM_scripting%EF%BC%9Bhttps:/wiki.freecad.org/CAM_Job",
